  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "页面里浮出一块带圆角、四周留白的面板，从右侧滑进来，背后的页面只蒙一层薄纱、仍然看得见；面板底部固定重置和「应用」。适合筛选、排序、设置这类顺手调一下的辅助操作，打开时不必离开当前页面。",
  "usage": "页面内辅助操作的通用容器（筛选、排序、设置、快捷编辑）：打开后原页面仍清晰可见，右侧浮出一块 300px 宽的面板，底部固定重置/应用。",
  "caution": "要看详情、编辑整页内容、需要压暗原页面时用「侧滑子页面」；原页面必须同时可操作时用「并排滑入面板」；窄屏改用底部面板。",
  "hint": "点「筛选」，抽屉从右侧浮出、页面只蒙一层薄纱；点 ✕ 或薄纱收起",
  "inspiration": "",
  "related": [
    "侧滑子页面",
    "并排滑入面板"
  ],
  "prompt": "【侧滑抽屉】目标：页面内的辅助操作容器（筛选、排序、设置），点按钮后从右侧滑入，原页面仍清晰可见、只蒙一层很淡的薄纱。\n\n1) 结构：.app（原页面）+ .scrim（薄纱）+ aside.drawer > .dh 标题栏 + .db 内容区 + .df 底部动作条。drawer 用 position:fixed，`top:12px;right:12px;bottom:12px;width:300px`，四周留白 + `border-radius:14px`——**浮在页面上**，不是贴满全高的整页。\n\n2) **和「侧滑子页面」的区别**（最容易做重，必须写进实现）：\n   - 抽屉 = 页面内工具面板：轻薄纱（`color-mix(in srgb,#000 10%,transparent)`，不加 backdrop-filter），原页面内容照样能读；宽度 300；底部固定「重置 / 应用」；操作可撤销。\n   - 子页面 = 页面级子页：遮罩 46% + blur，原页面压暗且不可操作；宽度 380–420；内容是完整的详情/编辑一屏。\n   - 判断标准：用户是「在列表上顺手调一下」还是「进去看一整个东西」。\n\n3) 动画：drawer 默认 `translateX(calc(100% + 14px))`（要移出 right:12px 的留白），打开归位，0.32 秒 cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.26,1)；薄纱 opacity 0 → 1，0.24 秒 ease。必须用 100%+14px 而不是 100%，否则面板右边 12px 会露一条。\n\n4) 滚动条：.db 是 overflow:auto，必须自绘细滚动条（10px、无箭头、thumb 用 text 色 30% 透明、hover 50%、`@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar)` 才给 scrollbar-width 兜底）——**同时写 scrollbar-width 会让 Chromium 忽略 webkit 伪元素**，退回带箭头的系统滚动条。\n\n5) 底部动作条固定：.df 不随内容滚，内容区自己滚；否则筛选项多了按钮会跑出视野。\n\n6) 交互：点触发按钮打开；点 ✕、薄纱、Esc 关闭；关闭后焦点回到触发按钮。\n\n7) 无障碍：role=\"dialog\" + aria-modal=\"true\" + aria-labelledby；关闭按钮 aria-label；chip 用 aria-pressed 表示选中。\n\n8) 配色：只用 --ui-*；应用按钮文字用 var(--ui-bg)；阴影用 color-mix 叠 #000。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 里循环；首轮延迟 300 毫秒；光标移到「筛选」→ 按下 → 打开抽屉 → 移到 ✕ → 按下 → 关闭 → cursor.hide()。\n\n10) 使用场景：见 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n/* ---------- 原页面 ---------- */\n.app{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:14px 16px}\n.bar{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.bar b{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.bar .cnt{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.fbtn{margin-left:auto;flex:0 0 auto;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease}\n.fbtn:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 42%,var(--ui-border));background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.fbtn.pressing,.fbtn:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n.fbtn em{font-style:normal;font-size:10px;line-height:1;padding:3px 5px;border-radius:999px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 14%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.list{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;overflow:hidden}\n.orow{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);font-size:11px;min-width:0}\n.orow .no{color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;flex:0 0 auto}\n.orow .nm{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}\n.orow .pr{margin-left:auto;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;flex:0 0 auto}\n.orow .st{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:10px;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap}\n.orow .st.pay{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-warn) 14%,transparent);color:var(--ui-warn)}\n\n/* ---------- 薄纱：轻遮罩，刻意不压暗原页面（这是和「侧滑子页面」最大的区别） ---------- */\n.scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:10;background:color-mix(in srgb,#000 10%,transparent);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .24s ease}\n.scrim.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n\n/* ---------- 抽屉：浮在页面上的面板，四周留白 + 圆角，不贴边 ---------- */\n.drawer{position:fixed;z-index:20;top:12px;right:12px;bottom:12px;width:300px;max-width:calc(100% - 72px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:-6px 0 26px color-mix(in srgb,#000 16%,transparent);transform:translateX(calc(100% + 14px));transition:transform .32s cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.26,1);outline:none;overflow:hidden}\n.drawer.open{transform:none}\n.dh{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-border) 72%,transparent)}\n.dh b{font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.dh .dsub{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.x{margin-left:auto;width:26px;height:26px;flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,background .15s ease,color .15s ease}\n.x:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.x.pressing,.x:active{transform:scale(.92)}\n.db{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:13px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px}\n\n/* 自绘滚动条：细、无箭头、淡色，悬停加深（复用库里的「滚动条」设计）。\n   只写 webkit 伪元素——同时写 scrollbar-width/color 会让 Chromium 整体忽略它们。 */\n.db::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}\n.db::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.db::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:8px 0}\n.db::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n.db::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 50%,transparent);background-clip:padding-box}\n.db::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .db{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n}\n\n.grp{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}\n.gl{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);letter-spacing:.2px}\n.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.chip{border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .1s ease,border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease,color .15s ease}\n.chip:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 36%,var(--ui-border));color:var(--ui-text)}\n.chip.on{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 15%,transparent);border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 48%,var(--ui-border));color:var(--ui-text);font-weight:600}\n.chip.pressing,.chip:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n.df{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-border) 72%,transparent);background:var(--ui-surface)}\n.reset{flex:0 0 auto;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:12px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,background .15s ease,color .15s ease}\n.reset:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.reset.pressing,.reset:active{transform:scale(.96)}\n.apply{flex:1;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg);font:inherit;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,filter .15s ease}\n.apply:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}\n.apply.pressing,.apply:active{transform:scale(.98)}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .app{padding:10px 12px;gap:7px}\n  .bar b{font-size:12px}\n  .fbtn{font-size:10px;padding:4px 9px}\n  .orow{padding:6px 8px;font-size:10px;gap:6px;border-radius:8px}\n  .drawer{top:8px;right:8px;bottom:8px;width:68%;max-width:68%}\n  .dh{padding:7px 10px}\n  .dh b{font-size:11px}\n  .dh .dsub{font-size:9px}\n  .x{width:22px;height:22px;font-size:11px}\n  .db{padding:8px 10px;gap:8px}\n  .db::-webkit-scrollbar{width:8px}\n  .db::-webkit-scrollbar-track{margin:5px 0}\n  .db::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{border-width:2px;border-right-width:3px}\n  .gl{font-size:9px}\n  .chip{font-size:10px;padding:3px 8px}\n  .df{padding:6px 10px}\n  .reset,.apply{font-size:10px;padding:6px 10px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .drawer,.scrim,.chip,.fbtn,.x,.reset,.apply{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"bar\"><b>订单</b><span class=\"cnt\">共 128 条</span>\n    <button class=\"fbtn\" id=\"openBtn\" type=\"button\">筛选<em>3</em></button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"orow\"><span class=\"no\">#10241</span><span class=\"nm\">张明 · 无线键盘</span><span class=\"pr\">¥268</span><span class=\"st pay\">待付款</span></div>\n    <div class=\"orow\"><span class=\"no\">#10240</span><span class=\"nm\">李婷 · 机械鼠标</span><span class=\"pr\">¥129</span><span class=\"st\">已发货</span></div>\n    <div class=\"orow\"><span class=\"no\">#10239</span><span class=\"nm\">王浩 · 显示器支架</span><span class=\"pr\">¥459</span><span class=\"st\">已完成</span></div>\n    <div class=\"orow\"><span class=\"no\">#10238</span><span class=\"nm\">周宁 · 桌面收纳盒</span><span class=\"pr\">¥89</span><span class=\"st\">已完成</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"scrim\" id=\"scrim\"></div>\n\n<aside class=\"drawer\" id=\"drawer\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"dTitle\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n  <div class=\"dh\">\n    <b id=\"dTitle\">筛选</b>\n    <span class=\"dsub\">订单列表</span>\n    <button class=\"x\" id=\"closeBtn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭\">✕</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"db\" id=\"db\">\n    <div class=\"grp\">\n      <div class=\"gl\">订单状态</div>\n      <div class=\"chips\">\n        <button class=\"chip on\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">待付款</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">已发货</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">已完成</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">已取消</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grp\">\n      <div class=\"gl\">下单时间</div>\n      <div class=\"chips\">\n        <button class=\"chip on\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">近 7 天</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">今天</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">近 30 天</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">自定义</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grp\">\n      <div class=\"gl\">金额区间</div>\n      <div class=\"chips\">\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">100 元以下</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">100–500 元</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">500 元以上</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grp\">\n      <div class=\"gl\">支付方式</div>\n      <div class=\"chips\">\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">微信支付</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">支付宝</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">银行卡</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grp\">\n      <div class=\"gl\">来源渠道</div>\n      <div class=\"chips\">\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">小程序</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">App</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">网页</button>\n        <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">线下门店</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"df\">\n    <button class=\"reset\" id=\"resetBtn\" type=\"button\">重置</button>\n    <button class=\"apply\" id=\"applyBtn\" type=\"button\">应用筛选</button>\n  </div>\n</aside>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var drawer = document.getElementById('drawer'),\n      scrim = document.getElementById('scrim'),\n      closeBtn = document.getElementById('closeBtn'),\n      openBtn = document.getElementById('openBtn'),\n      resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn'),\n      dbEl = document.getElementById('db');\n\n  var isOpen = false, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false, trigger = null;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function') cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  function open(btn){\n    if(isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = true;\n    trigger = btn || openBtn;\n    drawer.classList.add('open');\n    scrim.classList.add('open');\n    try { drawer.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 老浏览器不支持 preventScroll：宁可不动焦点，也不裸 focus（会把外层页面滚过来） */ }\n  }\n  function close(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    drawer.classList.remove('open');\n    scrim.classList.remove('open');\n    if(trigger && typeof trigger.focus === 'function'){\n      try { trigger.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 同上：不裸 focus */ }\n    }\n    trigger = null;\n  }\n\n  openBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ open(openBtn); });\n  closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close);\n  scrim.addEventListener('click', close);\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    var chips = dbEl.querySelectorAll('.chip');\n    for(var i = 0; i < chips.length; i++){\n      var label = chips[i].textContent;\n      var on = label.indexOf('全部') > -1 || label.indexOf('近 7 天') > -1;\n      chips[i].classList.toggle('on', on);\n      chips[i].setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n  });\n  dbEl.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    var t = e.target;\n    if(!t || !t.classList || !t.classList.contains('chip')) return;\n    var chips = t.parentNode.querySelectorAll('.chip');\n    for(var i = 0; i < chips.length; i++){\n      chips[i].classList.remove('on');\n      chips[i].setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');\n    }\n    t.classList.add('on');\n    t.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape' && isOpen) close();\n  });\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    close();\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(function(){ open(openBtn); }, 450);\n      later(close, 2600);\n      later(demoCycle, 3600);\n      return;\n    }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(openBtn);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      openBtn.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        openBtn.classList.remove('pressing');\n        open(openBtn);\n        later(function(){\n          cursor.moveTo(closeBtn);\n          later(function(){\n            cursor.press();\n            closeBtn.classList.add('pressing');\n            later(function(){\n              cursor.release();\n              closeBtn.classList.remove('pressing');\n              close();\n              if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide();\n              later(demoCycle, 1700);\n            }, 190);\n          }, 520);\n        }, 1400);\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){ /* 弹窗里只绑真实交互 */ }\n  else { setTimeout(demoCycle, 300); }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
